@baseUrl = http://localhost:5209
@token = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_ADMIN_TOKEN
@receiptId = REPLACE_WITH_RECEIPT_ID

### Configuration status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounting/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### All matching receipts, dates inclusive
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounting/receipts?start=2026-01-01&end=2026-12-31&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Recognize saved image
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounting/receipts/{{receiptId}}/recognize
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Download all matching original images, not just a page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounting/receipts/export?start=2026-01-01&end=2026-12-31&isConfirmed=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}